0 FILE orion-cardan.ldr
0 Orion - Double Cardan drive
0 Name: orion-cardan.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/orion-cardan.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // Original Orion design assembled with OpenAI assistance.
0 // New native PlacedModel exported by the unchanged Brickwright serializeModel function.
0 // Application Author is the native serializer default; design provenance is stated above.
0 // Two equal-angle universal joints transmit rotation through an offset shaft.
0 // Four stock 62520 fork references imply two real 62519 crosses in native Robot Lab.
0 // The two crosses are additional physical hardware, inferred by the unchanged native runtime.
0 // Motor A drives only the input; intermediate and output shafts are passive.
0 // No custom constraints, collision edits or scripted output poses.
0 // Companion: orion-cardan.bw. Robot Lab Plain; open model, then Code > To blocks.
0 // Reset the complete model before running and before repeating the demonstration.
0 // Kinematic demonstrator; physical assembly, output loading and efficiency are untested.
